; lake_ice_caves.room - Grutas de Gelo: the way from the waterfall's top to the Frost Guardian (design 04 section 3.5).
; No gate: single jumps over a hump, a dip and a raised shelf.
; The shelf is hollow behind its west face: a [secret] (cols 26-28, rows 7-8, cracked at col 26) with a reward slot (`$`, WORLD-35)
; and a stone [back] wall behind it, as an enclosed hollow shows rock (WORLD-31).

